xample: `const gl = canvas.getContext("webgl");`<br>* **WebRTC:** Enable real-time audio and video communication over the web. Example: `navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia()`<br>* **Artificial Intelligence (AI):** Integrate AI capabilities, such as machine learning and natural language processing. Example: `ml.predict({ input: [1, 2, 3] })`<br>* **Web Assembly (WASM):** Execute high-performance code written in languages like C++ or Rust. Example: `WebAssembly.instantiate(arrayBuffer)`<br><br><strong>2: Alternative project ideas and their benefits:</strong><br><br>**Alternative Project Ideas**<br><br><ul><br>  <li><b>Community Garden</b><br>    <br>Benefits:<br>    <ul><br>      <li>Promotes community engagement and collaboration</li><br>      <li>Provides fresh, healthy food to residents</li><br>      <li>Enhances the local environment and biodiversity</li><br>    </ul><br>  </li><br>  <li><b>Community Art Project</b><br>    <br>Benefits:<br>    <ul><br>      <li>Fosters creativity and self-expression</li><br>      <li>Beautifies the community and creates shared spaces</li><br>      <li>Promotes cultural exchange and understanding</li><br>    </ul><br>  </li><br>  <li><b>Environmental Restoration Project</b><br>    <br>Benefits:<br>    <ul><br>      <li>Improves air and water quality</li><br>      <li>Restores biodiversity and wildlife habitats</li><br>      <li>Educates the community about environmental issues</li><br>    </ul><br>  </li><br>  <li><b>Educational Program for Underprivileged Youth</b><br>    <br>Benefits:<br>    <ul><br>      <li>Provides access to education and enrichment opportunities</li><br>      <li>Inspires and empowers young people</li><br>      <li>Contributes to breaking the cycle of poverty</li><br>    </ul><br>  </li><br>  <li><b>Senior Citizen Support Initiative</b><br>    <br>Benefits:<br>    <ul><br>      <li>Provides assistance and companionship to elderly residents</li><br>      <li>Reduces isolation and loneliness</li><br>      <li>